    {
      "name": "arTaH",
      "value": "avakalkane",
      "note": "asya DAtoH arTasya vizaye kOmudyAm ucyate - avakalkanaM miSrIkaraRamityeke . cintanamityanye . 'avakalkana' Sabdasya kEScana paRqitEH 'miSrIkaraRam' (mixing) iti arTaH svIkriyate, kEScana anyEH ca 'cintanam' iti arTaH svIkriyate - iti asya ASayaH ."
    },
    {
      "name": "English Meaning",
      "value": "to mix, to think"
    },
    {
      "name": "hindI arTa",
      "value": "milAnA, miSrita karanA, ciMtana karanA"
    },
    {
      "name": "DAturUpanandinIwippaRI",
      "value": "' BuvaH avakalpane ' Ric syAt . avakalkanaM miSrIkaraRam ityeke . cintanamityanye . mA.DA.vfttO kfdantarUpamAlAyAM ca asya DAtoH arTasya vizaye vistftA carcA vihitA dfSyate . puruzakAraH vadati - ' mUlaSudDiH atra kIdfSI iti na vidmaH ' iti . ' sattAyAM Bavati, prAptO Rici BAvayate taNi . Bavate Sapi tatrEva BAvayatyavakalkane ' (Slo. 3) - devaH ."
    },
